<title>JAPAN: Sasaki Glass -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sasaki Glass -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.25		vs	    5.98</p>
<p> Operating	  387    million	  vs	  271    million</p>
<p> Current	    210    million	  vs	   53    million</p>
<p> Net		  124    million	  vs	    2.65</p>
<p> EPS		    2.93 yen	  vs	   62.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     43 million	  vs	  43 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sasaki Glass Co Ltd is a maker of glass tableware.</p>
